# Project: EEJS Portfolio

## Stack
Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion (modals only)

## Architecture
Single-page portfolio on `/` with anchor-nav sections; dedicated sub-pages for full content (`/about`, `/projects`, `/experiences`, `/certificates`, `/contact`). Data lives in `lib/data/`.

## Naming & Conventions
- Components in `components/` grouped by `layout/`, `sections/`, `common/`
- Section components export default, used on home page
- Profile content centralized in `lib/data/profile.ts`
- CSS design tokens in `app/globals.css` (`--accent`, `--surface`, etc.)

## Key Constraints
- Dark minimal theme with emerald accent (`#34d399`)
- Max content width `max-w-3xl` for readability
- Prefer server components; `"use client"` only when needed (modals, filters, header scroll)

## Folder Structure
```
app/           — routes and globals.css
components/    — layout, sections, common UI
lib/data/      — profile, projects, experience, certificates, social links
styles/        — legacy Galaxy background (unused)
```

## What NOT to Do
- Don't re-enable Galaxy/Three.js background without explicit request
- Don't add heavy animations or glassmorphism effects
- Don't scatter profile copy across components — use `profile.ts`
